# .gitignore — github-search skill bundle
#
# This file is what keeps the skill publishable: everything the skill needs to
# *work on your machine* lives in the paths below and is never committed.
# The skill reads its token from OUTSIDE this directory by preference:
#
#     1. $GITHUB_TOKEN / $GH_TOKEN                      (environment)
#     2. $DSH_HOME/secrets/github-search.json           (~/.dsh/secrets/... — recommended)
#     3. <this bundle>/.secrets/github-search.json      (portable fallback, ignored below)
#
# Copy config.example.json to one of those locations and put your token in it.

# --- credentials: never publish ---
.secrets/
config.local.json
config.json
*.token
*.tokens
*.secret
*.secrets
credentials.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- local noise ---
node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
